        "detailed_description": "Single player game.<br>3D all terrain strategy game.<br>Based on historical data of the Korean War, realistically restore war scenes, campaign units, equipment systems, and AI strategies.<br>The player will command the Chinese army and complete over 60 battles from October 24, 1950 to August 13, 1953.<br><br>In DLC, except for [essence Edition] and [Classic Edition], the rest are all linearly evolving according to the historical time. Players are kindly requested to purchase in order, without interrupting the timeline.<br><br>Game Body Pack: The first level of the first battle.<br><br>All DLC directories:<br>The complete version of the first battle, supplemented with four additional levels;<br>The second battle, 10 levels;<br>The third battle, 4 levels;<br>The fourth battle, 7 levels;<br>The fifth campaign attack phase consists of 7 levels;<br>The fifth campaign transition phase consists of 6 levels;<br>The 1951 United Nations summer offensive consisted of 8 levels;<br>The autumn offensive of the United Nations forces in 1951 consisted of four levels;<br>In the autumn counterattack of the Chinese People's Volunteer Army in 1952, there were 7 levels;<br>The Battle of Shangganling in 1952, consisting of three levels;<br>In the summer of 1953, the Volunteer Army launched a counterattack with 5 levels;<br>The Battle of Jincheng in 1953, one level;<br>The sixth battle, one level.<br><br>Price:<br>The basic price is determined based on the ratio of game price/game duration not exceeding 1 RMB/hour, and an incremental discount of 30% to 70% is given.<br>The complete bundle package comes with an additional 10% discount.<br><br>Official QQ group: 1044153448",
